cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "PersistAIBench: an evaluation benchmark for AI agents' memory truthfulness over long multi-step tasks"
authors:
  - family-names: Pandey
    given-names: Karmendra
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3461-9889"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-02
repository-code: "https://github.com/karmendra8386/persistbench-bench"
url: "https://github.com/karmendra8386/persistbench-bench"
abstract: "A deterministic benchmark for one unmeasured chain: a tool fails silently in Session 1, the agent writes its own account of the outcome into long-term memory, and different tasks in later sessions act on that memory — measuring cross-session propagation of silent agent failures, false-claim formation, and whether a write-time guard stops the propagation."
keywords:
  - LLM agents
  - benchmark
  - long-term memory
  - false-claim formation
  - agent evaluation
